HOW = '''<section class="how-sec" id="how"><div class="sec-head"><span class="kicker">How it works</span><h2>From raw odds to <span class="grad">clear picks</span></h2><p>Three steps run twice a day, every day, for every match we can price.</p></div><div class="how"><div class="how-card"><div class="how-num">01</div><h3>Scan the world</h3><p>Fixtures, live scores, scorers and tables from 200+ leagues, including the Saudi, UAE, Iranian and Russian top flights.</p></div><div class="how-card"><div class="how-num">02</div><h3>Remove the margin</h3><p>Bookmaker 1X2 odds become fair probabilities that add up to 100%. Unpriced leagues get a goals-based model estimate.</p></div><div class="how-card"><div class="how-num">03</div><h3>Rank the favorites</h3><p>Every match is sorted by the favorite's win chance, and results are tracked so you can see how often favorites deliver.</p></div></div></section>'''
